<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是变量吗</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>改不动的地方，就是你的天花板</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 74, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 4, border: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 25, color: "#1C1F23", marginLeft: 18}}>模型能不能换？</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 74, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 4, border: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 25, color: "#1C1F23", marginLeft: 18}}>工具能不能加？</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 74, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 4, border: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 25, color: "#1C1F23", marginLeft: 18}}>执行后端能不能换？</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 74, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Box style={{width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 4, border: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 25, color: "#1C1F23", marginLeft: 18}}>门禁能不能自己定？</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 74, borderBottom: "none"}}><Box style={{width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 4, border: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.30)"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 25, color: "#1C1F23", marginLeft: 18}}>事实能不能重建？</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 20}}>不是「它不好」，是「它替你决定了哪些可以改」——改得动几项？</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>23 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
